{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301161","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301161","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1430116101:0":{"text":"ああ、言うのを忘れてたよ、俺が鍛えた短剣と盾のことさ。","source_cn":"哦，忘了介绍，小光和大蓝是我锻造的短剑和盾牌。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC39C947ADBE7CF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430116102:0":{"text":"できた時から、あいつらは遠いサバンナへ旅立つ運命だったんだ。","source_cn":"它们在被锻造完成之时就已经注定要离我而去，去到遥远的赛凡纳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABDACB4EF4494984","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430116103:0":{"text":"俺にとっては子供みたいなもんだから、名残惜しくてな……","source_cn":"而我作为它们的创造者，当然会有些不舍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA50F3E280268F28C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:工匠弗瑞":{"text":"職人のフリュイ","source":"工匠弗瑞","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}